# This repository renders as the GitHub profile page at https://github.com/Adwrells.
#
# It previously tracked README.md alone, with a blanket `*` rule. That has been
# relaxed on purpose: the Claude Code setup (CLAUDE.md and .claude/skills/) is now
# committed so the profile's writing conventions and the avoid-ai-writing audit
# travel with the repo instead of living only on one machine.
#
# Only machine-local state is ignored.

# Claude Code local state.
#   settings.local.json — per-machine permissions, personal by convention.
#   worktrees/          — throwaway agent workspaces, and each is itself a git
#                         repository: committing one stores a gitlink, so a clone
#                         gets an empty directory pointing at a workspace that
#                         no longer exists.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
